1. Bot Startup Alert
What you get: 🟢 SMC Signal Bot Started & Scanning EUR/USD & XAU/USD

When you get it: Immediately when you launch or restart the bot script (python main.py).

2. Step 1: Liquidity Sweep Alert (status == "LIQUIDITY_SWEPT")
What you get:

Plaintext
🚨 STEP 1: LIQUIDITY SWEEP DETECTED 
📌 Asset: [EUR/USD or XAU/USD]
⚡ Direction Bias: [BUY/SELL]
📍 Swept Levels: Lows: ... | Highs: ...
💧 Liquidity Type: [Buy-Side / Sell-Side Liquidity Swept]
🔍 Looking for CHoCH at: Awaiting 15M structure break past boundary levels.
When you get it: When the engine confirms that the price has actually swept/pierced an external macro high or low liquidity level, initiating the directional bias. (Note: With the fix mentioned earlier, this will only trigger on a true confirmed sweep rather than every scan cycle).

3. Step 2: 15M CHoCH & FVG Confirmed Alert (status == "CHOCH_CONFIRMED")
What you get:

Plaintext
⏳ STEP 2: 15M CHoCH & FVG CONFIRMED 
📌 Asset: [...]
⚡ Direction: [...]
📍 CHoCH Happened At: [Price]
🎯 Active Watch (POI): [Price]
📝 Confluence: [Details]
When you get it: After the liquidity sweep has occurred, when the 15-minute timeframe breaks market structure (Change of Character / CHoCH) and leaves behind a Fair Value Gap (FVG) or Point of Interest (POI).

4. Setup Forming Advance Notice (status == "SETUP_FORMING")
What you get:

Plaintext
⏳ SMC SETUP FORMING (Advance Notice) 
📌 Asset: [...]
⚡ Anticipated Direction: [...]
🔍 Status: Macro criteria met. Monitoring 1M chart for entry at POI: [Price]
📝 Confluence: [...]
When you get it: When macro criteria (Sweep + CHoCH) are met and the bot starts actively tracking the 1-minute chart for a precise entry at the Point of Interest (POI).

5. Step 3: Final Execution Trigger & Lot PnL Breakdown (status == "TRIGGERED")
What you get:

Plaintext
🚨 STEP 3: SMC FINAL EXECUTION TRIGGER 
📌 Asset: [...]
⚡ Direction: [...]
🎯 Entry Price, Stop Loss, TP1, TP2, TP3, Risk:Reward ratio
📊 LOT SIZE PnL BREAKDOWN (0.01 to 1.0) with risk/reward dollar amounts
When you get it: Right when a 1-minute entry trigger is confirmed at the POI. This message includes your complete risk parameters and a PnL lot-sizing breakdown matrix.

6. Trade Management & Exit Alerts (SL / TP Hits)
What you get:

❌ STOP LOSS HIT for [Asset] at [Price]. Trade closed.

🎯 TP1 / TP2 REACHED for [Asset] at [Price]!

🏆 TP3 FULL TARGET REACHED for [Asset]! Trade fully closed.

When you get it: Dynamically during every scan cycle while an active trade is open, whenever the current 1-minute price crosses your pre-defined Stop Loss or Take Profit levels.